# ✨ QuoteVerse

QuoteVerse is a modern and interactive quote application built using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.  
It provides inspirational quotes with dynamic themes, category filtering, favorites management, and responsive UI design.

---

## 🚀 Features

- 🎯 Random quote generation using Fetch API
- 🌗 Dark / aesthetic theme toggle
- ❤️ Save favorite quotes using localStorage
- 📋 Copy quotes to clipboard
- 🐦 Share quotes directly on Twitter
- 🎨 Dynamic UI with glassmorphism design
- 📱 Fully responsive for desktop and mobile devices
- ✨ Smooth quote transition animations
- 🧠 Mood-based quote categories

---

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

- HTML5
- CSS3
- JavaScript (ES6)
- Fetch API
- localStorage
- Git & GitHub
- GitHub Pages

